<p>Saudi Arabia’s Civil Defence said a “military projectile” hit a residential area in Al-Kharj, in Riyadh Province, killing two people and injuring 12 others. Authorities said the incident, reported on March 8, struck a residential building. Al Jazeera said the reports came as tensions rose across the Gulf region. It noted that Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) had earlier said it targeted radar systems in several locations, including Al-Kharj, which it described as home to the Prince Sultan base.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Victim identities: The Hindu said Al-Arabiya reported one Indian national and one Bangladeshi national were killed, and that the injured were Bangladeshi residents.</li><li>Consular response: India said it would help its nationals in Saudi Arabia; Firstpost said the Indian Embassy urged citizens to stay alert.</li><li>Attribution gap: Saudi Civil Defence called it a “military projectile” but did not say who launched it, while Al Jazeera pointed to an earlier IRGC claim about targeting radar systems.</li><li>Spillover signals: Firstpost reported blasts were heard in Abu Dhabi as attacks continued across the Gulf region.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Saudi Civil Defence: It said a military projectile hit a residential area in Al-Kharj, killing and injuring residents. (<a href='https://english.aawsat.com/gulf/5248760-drone-damages-desalination-plant-bahrain'>Asharq Al-Awsat (English)</a>)</li><li>Iran’s IRGC: Al Jazeera reported that the IRGC had earlier said it targeted radar systems in several locations, including Al-Kharj. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/8/two-killed-in-saudi-arabia-after-projectile-falls-on-residential-building'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>Government of India: India said it would provide assistance to its nationals in Saudi Arabia. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/indian-national-among-two-killed-after-projectile-falls-in-saudi-residential-area/article70719923.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/indian-national-among-two-killed-after-projectile-falls-in-saudi-residential-area/article70719923.ece'>Indian national among two killed after projectile falls in Saudi residential area</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/8/two-killed-in-saudi-arabia-after-projectile-falls-on-residential-building'>Two killed in Saudi Arabia after ‘projectile’ falls on residential building</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/uae-news-live-updates-abu-dhabi-dubai-incident-flights-resume-iran-isarel-war-liveblog-13987098.html'>Two killed, 12 wounded by &#x27;projectile&#x27; in Saudi Arabia; Indian Embassy in urges citizens to remain alert</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://english.aawsat.com/gulf/5248760-drone-damages-desalination-plant-bahrain'>The Saudi Civil Defense reports that a military projectile struck a residential area in Al-Kharj, Riyadh Province, killing two people and injuring 12 others.</a> - aawsat.com</li></ul>